                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>二</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#26816B', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>定稿以哪一次发言{'\n'}为准？</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>最佳候选不能顶替定稿</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 368, height: 200, background: '#FFF4E6', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 44, height: 44, background: '#CB6B28', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>三</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#CB6B28', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>分母报的是{'\n'}哪一层？</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#546779', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>方案、共享、贡献、调用不可互换</Text>
            </Box>

        </Box>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#546779', marginTop: 6 }}>4.5 小组协作学习：把分散条件变成有依据的结论　·　第四章　面向问题的场景化应用</Text>

